<!-- delegatorChange.hbs -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>위임자 변경 알림 / Delegator Change Notification</title>
  <style>
    body{
      font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', Arial, sans-serif;
      background:#f4f4f4;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333;
    }
    .container{
      max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;
      border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }
    .header{
      background:#17a2b8;
      color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:30px 20px;
      border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;
    }
    .header h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;}
    .header h2{margin:8px 0 0 0;font-weight:400;}
    .content{padding:30px 20px;}
    .org-info{
      background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;
      border-left:4px solid #17a2b8;
    }
    .delegator-change{
      background:#e8f4f8;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;
    }
    .delegator-item{
      margin:15px 0;padding:15px;background:#fff;border-radius:4px;
      border-left:4px solid #28a745;
    }
    .delegator-item.previous{
      border-left-color:#dc3545;
      background:#fff5f5;
    }
    .change-info{
      font-size:14px;color:#6c757d;margin-top:15px;
      padding:10px;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:4px;
    }
    .footer{
      background:#f8f9fa;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;
      padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#6c757d;
      border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- ─── 헤더 ─── -->
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🔄 위임자 변경 알림</h1>
      <h2>Delegator Change Notification</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:18px">
        조직의 위임자가 변경되었습니다.<br/>
        The organization's delegator has been changed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 본문 ─── -->
    <div class="content">
      <!-- 조직 정보 -->
      <div class="org-info">
        <strong>🏢 조직 / Organization</strong>
        <h3 style="margin:10px 0;color:#17a2b8">{{organization.name}}</h3>
      </div>

      <!-- 위임자 변경 정보 -->
      <div class="delegator-change">
        <strong>👥 위임자 변경 내역 / Delegator Changes</strong>
        
        <div class="delegator-item previous">
          <strong>❌ 이전 위임자 / Previous Delegator</strong>
          <p style="margin:8px 0">
            {{organization.delegator.studentNumber}} {{organization.delegator.nameKr}}<br/>
            ({{organization.delegator.email}})
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="delegator-item">
          <strong>✅ 새로운 위임자 / New Delegator</strong>
          <p style="margin:8px 0">
            {{user.studentNumber}} {{user.nameKr}}<br/>
            ({{user.email}})
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 푸터 ─── -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>학생문화공간위원회 / Student Cultural Space Committee</strong></p>
      <p>위임자 변경을 알려드립니다.<br/>
         We are notifying you of the delegator change.</p>
      <p>문의사항이 있으시면 언제든 연락해 주세요.<br/>
         Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>